{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1305.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ec2b16381649b5c3366ef776c17b1913dfc880d7c212edb09e51532a48f38019","ja":"ねえ、桃子ちゃん。\nちょっと、相談したいことがあるんだけど、いい？","zh":"那个，桃子。\n我有点事想和你商量一下，可以吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1305.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"24c89db07202c1e006ead031980be981d930ee55346a3a8baeb3f5613ade6db6","ja":"えっ、なに？\n桃子に答えられることだったらいいけど……？","zh":"诶，什么事？\n只要是桃子答得上的事情就好……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1305.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a7e648e018307c608ec8e0dbc27e62b3768454eb6b984e7454dde8cb76276129","ja":"あのね、この前の映画、\nみんなお芝居、すっごく上手だったよね……？","zh":"那个啊，上次那部电影，\n大家的演技都超级棒对吧……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1305.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"846c659277114c7c3f8ed2747c0bfc6b0bb3c28285b7a96f2173b73c32e128ec","ja":"そうだね。みんな役に入ってて\n桃子もちょっと圧倒されちゃったかも。","zh":"是啊。大家都太入戏了，\n桃子可能也有点被震慑到了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1305.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6360f1cf352a505cb6f8719cec9be9d217153e72be3a2a92a2e1c9a6886fd686","ja":"うん。それでね、わたしもみんなみたいに\nお芝居がうまくなりたいの。どうしたらいいかな？","zh":"嗯。所以呢，我也想和大家一样\n演戏演得更好。该怎么做才好呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1305.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"834a76536d481659db7f4eb1d9e0050562c9f4bbdc0c8f3768facb566c5c76fc","ja":"育もちゃんとできてたと思うよ？\nでも……うん、分かったわ！","zh":"我觉得育也表现得很好哦？\n不过……嗯，我明白了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1305.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7f215a64a7effbc2983b4703a1474c00ed092bb5105909b5e8cd875d3542a8a5","ja":"それなら桃子が芸能界の先輩として、\nとっておきの方法を教えてあげる！","zh":"既然这样，桃子就作为演艺界的前辈，\n教你一个独家秘诀吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1305.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"dc2217d293c7c88e52f3851295095aaa9717da51153219dffdc5a04f29404dac","ja":"わあ、ありがとう！\nどうすればいいの？","zh":"哇，谢谢你！\n要怎么做才好呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1305.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a6ec0d890e485f5f3862167a555336d69c09f069f5faf3a447f5cbe16400b6b1","ja":"それはね……モノマネだよ！","zh":"那就是……模仿秀哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1305.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"119a680bea7f24730b57f84d8cc4ba832b5912dd0520f2a6dbf8ce24c5204a86","ja":"え、モノマネって……\nほかの人のマネをする、あのモノマネ！？","zh":"诶，模仿是指……\n去学别人样子的那种模仿！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1305.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b868858803a80e3155e5037f45399017bf9ef1c05708959bdab8a074ec630969","ja":"うん。桃子が見ててあげるから、\nためしにやってみて！","zh":"嗯。桃子会看着你的，\n试着做做看吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
